goobers-cloud dev

Usage:
  goobers-cloud <COMMAND> [OPTIONS]

Roles:
  api                Serve the cloud control-plane API.
  controller         Run cloud control-plane reconciliation.
  migrate            Apply cloud data-store migrations.
  worker             Run a Temporal engine worker.

Commands:
  completion         Generate a shell completion script.
  help               Show command help.
  status             Show cloud instance status through the API.
  runs list          List runs through the API.
  runs show          Show one run through the API.
  runs logs          Read one run's journal events through the API.
  claims list        List active claims through the API.
  claims release     Release a cloud claim.
  triggers           Submit a durable workflow trigger through the API.
  approve            Approve a paused stage through the API.
  override           Override a paused stage through the API.
  deny               Deny an escalated run through the API.
  cancel             Cancel a live run through the API.
  config apply       Apply cloud configuration.
  config status      Show cloud configuration status.
  migrate status     Show cloud schema migration status.
  lease status       Show cloud controller lease status.

Run `goobers-cloud help COMMAND` for command details.
